# The asset names of a hostkeeper release, one per line, `<version>` standing for X.Y.Z: the
# contract that cargo xtask release (crates/xtask/src/release/contract.rs, asset_names) keeps.
# A name may be added (add it here in the same pull request); a name is never removed or
# renamed, since consumers fetch assets by these names. Lines starting with `#` are comments.
# The `hello-` names are the packages and release indexes of the example service, examples/hello, and
# of its failing build (`hello-<version>-fail-ready-*`, the same package started with `--fail-ready`).
# The `pxe-` names are the package and release index of pxe, the boot server of network install (the two Linux platforms).
